  com.carsyn.options-validator.intraday-capture.plist -- TEMPLATE ONLY.

  Not installed by this session (owner-directed: deployment is a separate
  owner step). Runs tools/intraday_capture.sh five times per trading day
  (09:31 / 09:35 / 11:00 / 13:00 / 15:45 ET, Mon-Fri) against the OPS
  checkout (options-validator-ops), matching the existing daily-ritual
  LaunchAgent convention (tools/repo_rag/launchd/*.plist). The wrapper
  self-selects its session_tag from the wall clock and is a benign no-op if
  the machine was asleep through a scheduled moment.

  Install (see tools/launchagents/README.md for the full walkthrough):
    cp tools/launchagents/com.carsyn.options-validator.intraday-capture.plist \
       ~/Library/LaunchAgents/
    launchctl bootstrap gui/$UID \
       ~/Library/LaunchAgents/com.carsyn.options-validator.intraday-capture.plist
    launchctl enable gui/$UID/com.carsyn.options-validator.intraday-capture

  Uninstall:
    launchctl bootout gui/$UID/com.carsyn.options-validator.intraday-capture
    rm ~/Library/LaunchAgents/com.carsyn.options-validator.intraday-capture.plist
-->
